[[Image:Backstroke (PSF).png|thumb|300px|the '''backstroke''']]
==English==

===Etymology===
From [[back]] + [[stroke]]

===Pronunciation===
{{wikipedia}}
* {{audio|en-us-backstroke.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[swimming]] [[stroke]] swum lying on one's [[back]], while rotating both [[arm]]s through the water as to [[propel]] the swimmer [[backwards]].
# {{context|bellringing}} The [[pull]] on the [[tail]] of the [[rope]] that swings the [[bell]] through a full circle (compare [[handstroke]])

====Synonyms====
* [[back crawl]]

====Related terms====
* [[breaststroke]]
* [[butterfly]] stroke
* [[sidestroke]]

